#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:67
#: 9dc3f7e9bd6844c1a1138c3f74539022
msgid "Usage in FaSim"
msgstr "在 FaSim 中的用法"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:69
#: aa37f20aa306473a92c3686e6faed112
msgid ""
"Start Isaac with FaSim `./run.sh` (PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming "
"menu). Open the scene USD under `environment/fiveages_env/` (or `fa-"
"project-usd/`) in Isaac. There is no `./run.sh --env` flag."
msgstr ""
"用 FaSim `./run.sh` 启动 Isaac（PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming 菜单）。在 "
"Isaac 中打开 `environment/fiveages_env/`（或 `fa-project-usd/`）下的场景 USD。没有 "
"`./run.sh --env` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:71
#: f23104095df54a988191b10f45ba4256
msgid "Creating Custom Environments"
msgstr "创建自定义环境"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:73
#: 85fdecf665e44ce188fdc63693bfde46
msgid "Create the USD scene in Isaac Sim."
msgstr "在 Isaac Sim 里创建 USD 场景。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:74
#: 04a5991f850048268079666458604b4e
msgid ""
"Put it under `environment/fiveages_env/` or, with access, under [fa-"
"project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd)."
msgstr ""
"放到 `environment/fiveages_env/`，或有权限时放到 [fa-project-"
"usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:75
#: 6bce1b50b4934a479240ca6900b732ff
msgid ""
"Open that file from `./run.sh`. On `main`, a project is `scene.usd(a)`, "
"`objects/`, and `env/` ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-"
"project-usd/blob/main/README.md)). `robot.yaml`, `task_configs/`, and "
"`maps/` or `map/` sit on branch `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` "
"(ahead of `main`, not merged)."
msgstr ""
"用 `./run.sh` 打开该文件。在 `main` 上，一个项目是 `scene.usd(a)`、`objects/` 和 "
"`env/`（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd/blob/main/README.md)）。`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/` 以及 `maps/` 或 "
"`map/` 在分支 `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上（领先 `main`，尚未合入）。"

